# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900010> (dorsal part of intertransversarii laterales lumborum muscle)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:9780323393225") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://fipat.library.dal.ca/ta2/") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://purl.org/ccf/ASCTB-TEMP_dorsal-part-of-intertransversarii-laterales-lumborum-muscle") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900010> "A small skeletal back muscle that originates from the accessory process of one lumbar vertebra and inserts onto the transverse process of the adjacent (next inferior) lumbar vertebra, forming the posterior (dorsal) component of the lateral intertransverse muscles of the lumbar region; it contributes to lateral flexion and segmental stabilisation of the lumbar vertebral column.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900010> "https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_9606>)
