# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900023> (intertransversarii laterales lumborum muscle)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:9780323393225") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:7076562") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://fipat.library.dal.ca/ta2/") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://purl.org/ccf/ASCTB-TEMP_intertransversarii-laterales-lumborum-muscle") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900023> "A skeletal muscle organ that is one of a paired series of short segmental muscles connecting the transverse processes of adjacent lumbar vertebrae along their lateral aspect, innervated by ventral rami of the lumbar spinal nerves and acting to flex the lumbar spine laterally.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000233> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_9900023> "https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3707"^^xsd:anyURI)
